  times”, *Chemical Engineering Science*, 2, 1–13 (1953).
  <https://doi.org/10.1016/0009-2509(53)80001-1>
- M. Th. van Genuchten e J. C. Parker, “Boundary conditions for displacement
  experiments through short laboratory soil columns”, *Soil Science Society
  of America Journal*, 48, 703–708 (1984).
  <https://doi.org/10.2136/sssaj1984.03615995004800040002x>
